{"id":516,"title":"解答: 欧几里得算法","summary":"详细给出欧几里得算法挑战的参考答案。\n\n","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d5cded2c-654f-41ac-ab05-18396952b0ee","text":"## 欧几里得算法原理\n\n欧几里德算法又称辗转相除法，用于计算两个正整数a，b的最大公约数。算法依赖于定理:\n\n> 即如果两个数字的较大值被两个数字之间的差替换，那么两个数字的最大公约数不会改变。","text_html":"<h2>欧几里得算法原理</h2>\n<p>欧几里德算法又称辗转相除法，用于计算两个正整数a，b的最大公约数。算法依赖于定理:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>即如果两个数字的较大值被两个数字之间的差替换，那么两个数字的最大公约数不会改变。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Columns","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7532ae25-5784-4acb-a18d-d0d9413aac35","comps":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"colum_0_7532ae25-5784-4acb-a18d-d0d9413aac35","text":"我们来看看一个例子:\n\n$252$和$105$的GCD是$21$（$252$=$21$×$12$，$105$=$21$×$5$）。现在，$21$也是$105$和$147$的GCD（$252-105$）。用它们之间的差值（最初为$147$）替换数值较大的数字（最初为$252$），结果是较大的数字被还原成较小的数值。反复进行这种减法，将产生连续的较小的一对数字，最终将彼此相等。  当这种情况发生时，最终的数字就是我们开始时的两个原始数字的GCD。\n\n右边的动画是欧几里得算法的一个<u>基于subtraction的动画</u>。假设初始矩形的尺寸为$a = 1071$，$b = 462$。两个大小为$462$ × $462$的黄色方块被放置在其中，留下一个$462$ × $(1071-462-462 = )147$的矩形。这个矩形被铺上$147$×$147$的蓝色方块，直到剩下一个$21$×$147$的矩形，而这个矩形又被铺上$21$×$21$的红色方块，没有留下任何未覆盖区域。最小的正方形尺寸$21$，是$1071$和$462$的GCD。","text_html":"<p>我们来看看一个例子:</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">252</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">105</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span></span></span></span>的GCD是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">252</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>=<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>×<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">105</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span></span></span></span>=<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>×<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span></span></span></span>）。现在，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>也是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">105</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">147</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span></span></span></span>的GCD（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">252-105</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span></span></span></span>）。用它们之间的差值（最初为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">147</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span></span></span></span>）替换数值较大的数字（最初为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">252</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>），结果是较大的数字被还原成较小的数值。反复进行这种减法，将产生连续的较小的一对数字，最终将彼此相等。  当这种情况发生时，最终的数字就是我们开始时的两个原始数字的GCD。</p>\n<p>右边的动画是欧几里得算法的一个<u>基于subtraction的动画</u>。假设初始矩形的尺寸为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a = 1071</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">a</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 462</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">b</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>。两个大小为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">462</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">462</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>的黄色方块被放置在其中，留下一个<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">462</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>)</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1071-462-462 = )147</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span></span></span></span>的矩形。这个矩形被铺上<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">147</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span></span></span></span>×<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">147</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span></span></span></span>的蓝色方块，直到剩下一个<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>×<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">147</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span></span></span></span>的矩形，而这个矩形又被铺上<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>×<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>的红色方块，没有留下任何未覆盖区域。最小的正方形尺寸<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>，是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1071</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">462</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>的GCD。</p>\n"},"width":50},{"type":"MxGraphWidget","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"colum_1_7532ae25-5784-4acb-a18d-d0d9413aac35","caption":"欧几里得算法 - 维基百科","file":"/content/assets/5ecc0ecfd8ea9433775f.svg","path":"","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"434px\" height=\"418px\" version=\"1.1\"><defs/><g transform=\"translate(0.5,0.5)\"><image x=\"30.5\" y=\"6.5\" width=\"164\" height=\"380\" xlink:href=\"data:image/gif;base64,\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><path d=\"M 32 407 L 185.63 407\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><path d=\"M 190.88 407 L 183.88 410.5 L 185.63 407 L 183.88 403.5 Z\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" pointer-events=\"none\"/><g transform=\"translate(70.5,397.5)\"><switch><foreignObject style=\"overflow:visible;\" pointer-events=\"all\" width=\"71\" height=\"19\" requiredFeatures=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.2; vertical-align: top; white-space: