8258\"><mxGeometry x=\"0.0421\" y=\"2\" relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"><mxPoint as=\"offset\"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id=\"6724\" value=\"\" style=\"endArrow=classic;html=1;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry width=\"50\" height=\"50\" relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"><mxPoint x=\"325\" y=\"103\" as=\"sourcePoint\"/><mxPoint x=\"376\" y=\"103\" as=\"targetPoint\"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id=\"8713\" value=\"&lt;i&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px&quot;&gt;21&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;\" style=\"text;html=1;resizable=0;points=[];align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;\" vertex=\"1\" connectable=\"0\" parent=\"6724\"><mxGeometry x=\"-0.075\" relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"><mxPoint as=\"offset\"/></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>","prev_path":"","prev_svg":"","prev_xml":"","wa_instantly_opened":true},"width":50}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8452ed85-2d1b-43f7-bfaf-c90ca27d4e5a","text":"## 参考答案\n\n在上一课中，我们提出了欧氏算法的挑战，要求你用欧氏算法计算两个数字的最大公约数（GCD）。下面给出实现代码:","text_html":"<h2>参考答案</h2>\n<p>在上一课中，我们提出了欧氏算法的挑战，要求你用欧氏算法计算两个数字的最大公约数（GCD）。下面给出实现代码:</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a22ef1b1-f4d5-470f-bf1c-4d9d811d9f97","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_a22ef1b1-f4d5-470f-bf1c-4d9d811d9f97","title":"Euclidean_Algorithm","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def euclidean_algorithm(x, y):\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the euclidean of two numbers\n    :param x: First number\n    :param y: Second number\n    :return: Returns the euclidean of two given numbers i.e. x and y\n    \"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return y\n    return euclidean_algorithm(y % x, x)\n\n\n# Driver code to test above function\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n\n    num1 = 1071\n    num2 = 462\n\n    result = euclidean_algorithm(num1, num2)\n    print('The GCD of ', num1, 'and ', num2, 'is ', result)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"8 10","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3221e0bd-d726-49a8-b549-8a8091f7e361","text":"### 解释\n\n**第8-10行**：检查第1个数字（`x`，在递归调用中通过$(y\\%x)$获得）是否为0。否则，我们进行下一个递归调用`euclidean_algorithm(y % x, x)`。\n\n> 该算法也有一个*迭代*版本，使用`while x != 0`循环，而不是**递归**调用函数。两个版本都给出了类似的时间复杂度。\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n该算法时间复杂度是$O(log \\ min(x, y))$。","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<p><strong>第8-10行</strong>：检查第1个数字（<code>x</code>，在递归调用中通过<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y\\%x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>获得）是否为0。否则，我们进行下一个递归调用<code>euclidean_algorithm(y % x, x)</code>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>该算法也有一个<em>迭代</em>版本，使用<code>while x != 0</code>循环，而不是<strong>递归</strong>调用函数。两个版本都给出了类似的时间复杂度。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>该算法时间复杂度是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log \\ min(x, y))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4a6e19d1-7f0f-462d-960a-ea90e620f389","text":"---\n\n现在，进入课程的下一个分而治之算法挑战!","text_html":"<hr />\n<p>现在，进入课程的下一个分而治之算法挑战!</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/516"}
